  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Cut sweet potato into wedges. Cut corn cobs in half.\n• Place wedges on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with a pinch of salt and toss to coat.\n• Bake until tender, 25-30 minutes.\n• When there is 20 minutes remaining, add corn cobs to wedges tray and roast until tender and slightly charred, 15-20 minutes. TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f87b09cade9b9f0acf5f9d/step-c9c45700.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When the fries have 10 minutes remaining, in a large frying pan, heat enough olive oil to coat base over medium-high heat.\n• Cook plant-based crumbed chicken until golden and heated through, 2-3 minutes on each side.\n• Remove frying pan from the heat, then sprinkle over savoury seasoning, sweet & savoury glaze, tossing plant-based crumbed chicken to coat.\n• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f87b09cade9b9f0acf5f9d/step-bbdf6310.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a large bowl, combine slaw mix, and ranch dressing. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f87b09cade9b9f0acf5f9d/step-8cf7db20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide sweet potato wedges, BBQ plant-based crumbed chicken and ranch slaw between plates.\n• Tear over coriander to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f87b09cade9b9f0acf5f9d/step-6c0cf530.jpg"
    }
  ]
